WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.126 --> 01:37.960
=Episode 28=

01:39.600 --> 01:40.520
Madam Zhao.

01:44.761 --> 01:46.520
Your tactics have grown sharper.

01:46.520 --> 01:48.041
You know how to use personal ties
to orchestrate a scheme.

01:48.720 --> 01:50.921
You managed to mend even the rift

01:50.921 --> 01:51.921
between the Emperor and his grandmother.

01:52.160 --> 01:53.600
Impressive indeed.

01:54.800 --> 01:56.121
You jest, Madam Yu.

01:56.841 --> 01:58.841
I only used sincerity
to break the deadlock.

01:59.281 --> 02:00.921
You simply refuse to believe

02:01.041 --> 02:02.841
that true feelings do exist
in this world.

02:04.720 --> 02:05.600
After all,

02:06.201 --> 02:07.080
His Majesty

02:07.201 --> 02:09.760
was raised by Her Majesty herself.

02:10.440 --> 02:12.040
That bond of blood and love

02:12.200 --> 02:13.281
cannot be faked.

02:15.081 --> 02:17.401
You suffered so much in Huaying.

02:18.121 --> 02:19.640
How can you still believe

02:19.841 --> 02:22.121
that a grandmother
would truly love her grandson?

02:25.920 --> 02:28.040
I have not only endured the hardships
of Huaying.

02:30.401 --> 02:32.040
I have also lived in Ganlin Town.

02:36.640 --> 02:38.521
I have seen husbands and wives
who truly care for each other.

02:39.401 --> 02:40.880
Comrades who protect each other
with their lives.

02:41.480 --> 02:42.401
The military wives,

02:42.440 --> 02:43.841
though bound by no blood,

02:43.961 --> 02:45.281
are closer than sisters.

02:46.401 --> 02:47.361
Are those

02:47.841 --> 02:49.241
not real feelings?

02:51.081 --> 02:53.121
If I only remembered the suffering
in Huaying

02:54.361 --> 02:56.121
and ignored all this love and loyalty,

02:57.681 --> 02:58.841
then whether I win

02:59.160 --> 03:00.081
or lose

03:00.480 --> 03:01.401
in this life

03:02.361 --> 03:03.320
would no longer matter.

03:06.081 --> 03:07.961
What good is it to climb so high?

03:08.961 --> 03:10.401
Even if you reach the pinnacle of power,

03:10.760 --> 03:11.681
you would be nothing more

03:13.040 --> 03:14.681
than a walking corpse.

03:17.121 --> 03:17.760
Madam,

03:18.480 --> 03:19.480
no matter where

03:20.081 --> 03:22.160
my husband's future may lead him,

03:23.040 --> 03:24.880
whether he becomes a regional commander,

03:25.281 --> 03:26.040
or

03:26.600 --> 03:28.040
a grand chancellor or marquis

03:28.961 --> 03:29.880
all I know

03:30.640 --> 03:32.121
is I would not want to live

03:32.281 --> 03:33.401
the way you do.

03:34.640 --> 03:36.320
Even with boundless wealth

03:36.801 --> 03:38.001
and great power in your hands,

03:39.281 --> 03:40.401
is there any true love

03:40.880 --> 03:41.640
between husband and wife,

03:42.040 --> 03:43.160
parent and child,

03:44.760 --> 03:45.880
or mother-in-law and daughter-in-law?

04:17.440 --> 04:18.001
My dear.

04:18.121 --> 04:19.320
You're back.

04:20.280 --> 04:22.161
This move of ours has failed.

04:22.161 --> 04:24.200
Instead, Zhao Ling has gained
even more favor.

04:24.481 --> 04:26.520
Things have become highly troublesome.

04:26.520 --> 04:28.681
You must find a solution quickly.

04:32.440 --> 04:33.280
Master,

04:34.080 --> 04:36.241
I have not been feeling well lately.

04:37.080 --> 04:38.840
Can we hold off for a while?

04:38.840 --> 04:39.960
Hold off?

04:39.960 --> 04:41.200
Are you joking?

04:41.200 --> 04:42.921
The salt reform is urgent.

04:42.921 --> 04:43.361
You...

04:43.361 --> 04:45.161
How can you claim illness now?

04:47.241 --> 04:49.320
You couldn't have picked a worse time.

04:56.921 --> 04:57.921
Ms. Shu.

05:00.041 --> 05:02.080
After all these years with my husband,

05:04.801 --> 05:06.760
can it be called true love?

05:08.080 --> 05:10.481
I have shaped myself
into his sharpest blade.

05:11.880 --> 05:13.041
Inseparable.

05:15.001 --> 05:16.801
Is that not true love?

05:18.960 --> 05:19.721
Madam.

05:23.960 --> 05:24.840
Forget it.

05:27.320 --> 05:28.880
This is the path I chose.

05:31.041 --> 05:32.921
I cannot be like Fan,

05:33.960 --> 05:35.400
wanting both dignity

05:37.241 --> 05:38.640
and true love.

05:41.681 --> 05:42.440
Madam,

05:42.601 --> 05:43.721
please have a seat.

05:44.520 --> 05:45.080
Come on.

05:45.280 --> 05:45.960
Take a seat.

05:56.601 --> 05:57.161
Mother.

06:05.760 --> 06:07.320
Zhao Ling has been restored to his post.

06:07.801 --> 06:09.801
We should send a generous gift as well.

06:10.241 --> 06:11.121
I understand.

06:12.601 --> 06:13.400
It is just that

06:14.361 --> 06:16.241
Fan has never gotten along
with the Ninth Young Lady.

06:17.280 --> 06:18.361
Perhaps

06:18.640 --> 06:19.721
we should send Concubine Wu instead.

06:26.121 --> 06:26.921
I take my leave.

06:29.601 --> 06:31.440
Send a concubine to visit?

06:31.880 --> 06:33.320
What was he thinking?

06:35.481 --> 06:36.760
Still,

06:37.481 --> 06:39.280
it might give Fu Tingyun

06:39.880 --> 06:41.200
some trouble.

06:42.241 --> 06:43.640
It can also be useful.

06:44.161 --> 06:45.440
How could a lowly concubine

06:45.760 --> 06:47.601
call on a fourth-rank official?

06:48.280 --> 06:49.280
Please calm down, Young Madam.

06:49.280 --> 06:50.161
How can I calm down?

06:51.440 --> 06:53.241
He won't even let me into his study,

06:54.241 --> 06:55.840
yet she can come and go as she pleases.

07:03.121 --> 07:04.361
I'd like to see

07:05.921 --> 07:07.601
who

07:08.760 --> 07:10.121
the real Young Madam Yu is.

07:12.543 --> 07:14.803
(Yu Residence)

07:23.320 --> 07:24.640
You've been here so long,

07:25.361 --> 07:27.161
with only Cairong to serve you.

07:27.601 --> 07:29.001
It's truly not right.

07:30.400 --> 07:31.161
Mozhan.

07:31.361 --> 07:32.041
Go and bring

07:32.041 --> 07:33.801
the indenture contracts
of the new maids.

07:43.200 --> 07:44.001
Concubine Wu,

07:44.921 --> 07:46.960
pick one that catches your eye.

07:48.400 --> 07:49.601
Thank you, Young Madam.

07:52.696 --> 07:53.886
(Indenture Contract)

07:53.893 --> 07:54.893
(Signatory: Zhao Shitou)

07:58.866 --> 08:00.620
(Signatory: Wu Youde.
Go-between: Ms. Wang)

08:02.733 --> 08:03.460
(Indenture Contract of Wu Youde)

08:03.460 --> 08:04.320
(Named Lingyi, age sixteen)

08:12.721 --> 08:13.440
What?

08:14.320 --> 08:15.400
Don't they suit your taste?

08:22.721 --> 08:23.601
You fool!

08:23.601 --> 08:24.801
The indenture of Concubine Wu

08:24.801 --> 08:26.440
should not be
with the servants' contracts.

08:29.280 --> 08:30.440
Take it away at once.

08:34.121 --> 08:34.601
Young Madam,

08:34.601 --> 08:36.601
you are his wife,
married with all due rites.

08:37.160 --> 08:38.760
I am nothing but a passing fancy.

08:39.520 --> 08:40.520
If I have offended you,

08:40.920 --> 08:42.160
it was thoughtless,

08:42.160 --> 08:43.160
not deliberate.

08:43.321 --> 08:44.001
And second,

08:44.640 --> 08:45.920
if I have been used as a tool,

08:46.441 --> 08:48.640
I had no choice but to play along.

08:49.481 --> 08:51.680
Why blame someone like me,
who was only a passing fancy?

09:03.201 --> 09:04.160
My Lady.

09:04.361 --> 09:05.400
How did your indenture contract

09:05.400 --> 09:06.880
end up with the Young Madam?

09:07.081 --> 09:08.400
Aren't you a noble concubine?

09:08.481 --> 09:09.841
They're far too cruel...

09:16.400 --> 09:18.121
But today, I finally see it clearly.

09:19.520 --> 09:21.001
What the Young Madam did today

09:21.680 --> 09:23.201
was not aimed at me.

09:24.241 --> 09:25.841
It was a warning to the Young Master.

09:28.001 --> 09:29.321
This quarrel between wife and concubine

09:29.920 --> 09:31.601
is really a quarrel
between husband and wife.

09:36.441 --> 09:37.640
In this household,

09:39.481 --> 09:40.400
my fate

09:40.640 --> 09:42.321
is not for her to decide.

09:53.441 --> 09:54.400
Such an exquisite painting.

09:54.800 --> 09:55.800
So lifelike.

09:58.520 --> 09:59.280
Young Master.

10:00.961 --> 10:01.880
I am restoring

10:01.880 --> 10:03.361
the painting for the ladies

10:03.481 --> 10:05.040
at Ji's first-year banquet.

10:06.961 --> 10:07.721
Is this

10:09.241 --> 10:10.241
the Ninth Young Lady?

10:12.481 --> 10:14.680
I've tried time and again to capture

10:15.081 --> 10:16.680
her grace and bearing,

10:16.680 --> 10:17.920
yet her spirit still eludes me.

10:19.520 --> 10:20.800
Who wouldn't admire

10:21.160 --> 10:22.321
a remarkable woman like her?

10:23.601 --> 10:25.001
Unlike me,

10:25.880 --> 10:27.121
lowly as dust.

10:27.841 --> 10:29.441
Even my own indenture contract

10:30.121 --> 10:31.841
is held in someone else's hands.

10:42.280 --> 10:43.640
Has she made things difficult for you?

10:48.680 --> 10:50.400
I will carefully rework

10:50.400 --> 10:52.001
this painting until it
captures her true likeness,

10:52.081 --> 10:53.441
so you may enjoy it at your leisure.

10:57.760 --> 10:58.441
Rest assured.

11:00.121 --> 11:00.880
I'll handle this

11:01.721 --> 11:02.680
for you.

11:13.280 --> 11:14.721
If a child is not taught,

11:14.961 --> 11:16.721
his nature will change.

11:17.321 --> 11:19.001
The way of teaching

11:19.441 --> 11:21.081
lies in focused dedication.

11:27.760 --> 11:28.481
You're here.

11:28.961 --> 11:30.441
You've grown quite bold,

11:31.361 --> 11:32.920
putting on airs
as the lady of the house,

11:33.841 --> 11:35.280
daring to meddle with my people?

11:35.841 --> 11:37.160
If you have any grievances,

11:37.601 --> 11:39.201
you can come and tell me directly.

11:39.880 --> 11:41.520
Why trouble a poor soul?

11:42.081 --> 11:43.800
I thought in your eyes,

11:45.280 --> 11:46.920
you were the only pitiful one.

11:48.280 --> 11:49.321
Who would have thought

11:50.361 --> 11:51.880
you'd start caring for others too?

11:53.680 --> 11:55.920
You come from a scholarly family.

11:56.400 --> 11:58.241
Why must your words be so sharp

11:58.241 --> 11:59.241
and bitter?

12:02.481 --> 12:04.321
When you made me share a room

12:04.321 --> 12:05.321
with a woman of unknown origin,

12:05.441 --> 12:06.160
did you ever consider

12:06.160 --> 12:07.520
the dignity of a scholar?

12:09.520 --> 12:10.441
Dignity?

12:11.001 --> 12:12.280
You want to be like Mother,

12:12.680 --> 12:14.441
a respected lady of the house.

12:14.441 --> 12:15.481
But have you considered

12:15.920 --> 12:16.880
that Mother never

12:16.880 --> 12:18.601
squabbled with a concubine?

12:21.001 --> 12:22.640
I was given some insight today.

12:23.721 --> 12:25.201
It made me realize something.

12:26.121 --> 12:28.361
The wife-concubine quarrel
is a husband-wife quarrel.

12:28.640 --> 12:30.441
Father and Mother were united.

12:31.241 --> 12:32.760
Father never made Mother

12:32.760 --> 12:34.121
feel as humiliated as I do now.

12:37.880 --> 12:39.680
I want to ask you one thing.

12:42.800 --> 12:43.441
Young Master,

12:50.601 --> 12:52.400
do you truly wish for us

12:55.001 --> 12:56.800
to drift apart

13:00.121 --> 13:01.481
and turn against each other?

13:24.441 --> 13:25.601
Whoever you love,

13:26.201 --> 13:27.160
whoever you value,

13:28.321 --> 13:29.081
that is fine.

13:29.400 --> 13:31.001
But why her?

13:33.201 --> 13:34.400
You even extended your favor

13:34.400 --> 13:36.640
by sending Concubine Wu in my place.

13:39.961 --> 13:42.481
Have you forgotten the past?

13:43.400 --> 13:45.001
You disregard my dignity.

13:45.001 --> 13:45.961
What about your own?

13:45.961 --> 13:47.321
Do not speak of the past again!

13:49.361 --> 13:50.121
Young Master,

13:51.481 --> 13:53.601
you won't even mention it now.

14:00.961 --> 14:02.280
Bring me Wu's indenture contract.

14:23.601 --> 14:25.601
I have already given you status
and dignity.

14:26.441 --> 14:27.880
From this marriage alone,

14:28.441 --> 14:30.201
you have gained more than enough honor.

14:30.721 --> 14:31.400
From now on,

14:33.601 --> 14:35.680
stop doing such unseemly things.

14:50.201 --> 14:52.201
My honor was given by you.

14:53.601 --> 14:55.841
Then who gave you yours?

15:02.224 --> 15:03.297
(Rosy in the Evening Glow)

15:03.321 --> 15:05.841
Fan is the future lady
of this household.

15:07.160 --> 15:08.721
You owe her dignity.

15:09.721 --> 15:11.001
But have you not always been

15:11.800 --> 15:13.361
the lady of this house, Mother?

15:13.961 --> 15:15.081
Even Wu

15:15.321 --> 15:17.361
was brought in under your authority.

15:24.640 --> 15:25.841
No matter how lovely a flower is,

15:25.841 --> 15:27.241
one grows tired of it.

15:27.841 --> 15:29.280
That is only natural.

15:29.920 --> 15:31.601
Whether you fertilize it

15:31.601 --> 15:32.680
or prune it,

15:33.441 --> 15:35.121
since it is planted in the pot,

15:35.361 --> 15:36.400
you must

15:36.400 --> 15:37.841
give it some water

15:38.280 --> 15:39.800
and not let it wither.

15:40.321 --> 15:41.800
Otherwise, my garden

15:42.441 --> 15:43.880
will not look as beautiful.

15:47.201 --> 15:48.121
Forgive me, Mother.

16:13.880 --> 16:14.601
Young Master.

16:14.721 --> 16:15.400
Please take a seat.

16:21.400 --> 16:22.920
Why are your hands so cold?

16:26.520 --> 16:27.201
I...

16:38.160 --> 16:39.121
Young Master,

16:39.920 --> 16:42.121
you came about the indenture contract,
didn't you?

17:04.760 --> 17:06.481
It is only right to give it
to the Young Madam.

17:29.800 --> 17:31.721
As long as I can stay by your side,

17:33.120 --> 17:34.441
that's all that matters.

17:41.130 --> 17:42.230
(Indenture Contract)

17:46.600 --> 17:47.961
Jingxiu was wrong

17:48.641 --> 17:49.721
to treat you poorly.

17:49.961 --> 17:51.641
Why did you not come to me?

17:53.001 --> 17:54.441
I did not dare to trouble you.

17:56.881 --> 17:57.961
Fu Tingyun

17:58.241 --> 17:59.881
wanted to enter the Yu family back then.

18:00.201 --> 18:01.721
She chose me,

18:01.921 --> 18:03.161
not my son.

18:04.241 --> 18:06.241
So many years have passed.

18:07.881 --> 18:10.080
I thought you would have understood that
by now.

18:13.520 --> 18:15.201
(From now on, you will listen to me.)

18:15.961 --> 18:17.681
(I will protect you well.)

18:27.040 --> 18:29.280
I am the Young Madam of the Yu family.

18:33.520 --> 18:35.001
Why does Concubine Wu

18:35.360 --> 18:36.961
live more freely than I do?

18:38.201 --> 18:39.760
What Mother said today

18:40.120 --> 18:42.280
was just moving me from Jingxiu's cage

18:44.280 --> 18:45.800
into her cage.

18:47.201 --> 18:49.080
Even as the Young Madam
of the Yu family,

18:49.401 --> 18:51.080
I am still being pushed around.

18:56.441 --> 18:58.441
Now I no longer want
to listen to anyone.

19:00.520 --> 19:02.080
Whether they think well of me

19:03.881 --> 19:05.120
or not,

19:07.520 --> 19:09.441
they have endured me all these years.

19:12.201 --> 19:13.881
Let them endure a few more.

19:14.580 --> 19:16.386
(Capital Specialties)

19:16.420 --> 19:17.881
This is top quality.

19:17.881 --> 19:18.961
One hundred taels.

19:27.760 --> 19:28.961
This piece of junk,

19:29.241 --> 19:30.040
one hundred taels?

19:30.681 --> 19:31.161
This...

19:31.641 --> 19:33.201
Do you take me for a fool?

19:34.401 --> 19:36.201
You jest, Madam.

19:40.840 --> 19:41.760
Charge it to my account.

19:43.441 --> 19:45.001
They say good jade has a spirit.

19:45.201 --> 19:46.441
Today, I see it is true.

19:48.760 --> 19:49.721
Who are you?

19:50.520 --> 19:52.800
My family runs a small business
in Anzhou.

19:53.120 --> 19:54.800
I only recently came to the capital.

19:55.080 --> 19:56.120
I have little talent,

19:57.040 --> 19:58.600
but I do have sharp eyes.

19:58.721 --> 20:01.161
I can recognize most

20:01.161 --> 20:02.320
of the prominent figures in the capital.

20:02.481 --> 20:04.441
You must be General Mo's wife.

20:15.441 --> 20:16.921
No one does anything without a reason.

20:17.161 --> 20:18.280
Why would you

20:18.280 --> 20:20.280
give me such a valuable gift?

20:20.600 --> 20:21.881
It's not really a gift.

20:22.120 --> 20:23.520
I am a regular here.

20:23.520 --> 20:24.641
I get a thirty percent discount.

20:25.080 --> 20:25.961
Under my name,

20:26.040 --> 20:26.760
seventy taels.

20:26.760 --> 20:27.320
How about that?

20:27.961 --> 20:28.481
Done.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.921
Then I will accept your kindness.

20:37.921 --> 20:38.921
Thank you, Madam.

20:39.001 --> 20:40.961
Do come by often when you have time.

20:40.961 --> 20:41.961
Mention my name.

20:41.961 --> 20:42.681
At the very least,

20:42.681 --> 20:44.080
I won't let you lose out.

20:54.161 --> 20:55.001
Aunt.

20:55.280 --> 20:56.320
She will certainly

20:56.401 --> 20:57.800
come looking for me again.

20:58.800 --> 21:01.040
Don't be fooled
by all the power in this capital.

21:01.161 --> 21:03.441
Human nature here is no different
from anywhere else.

21:04.080 --> 21:05.641
You offer them what they like,

21:05.641 --> 21:06.840
and slowly nurture the connection.

21:06.840 --> 21:08.401
Only then can they serve your purposes.

21:08.441 --> 21:09.280
Do you remember?

21:09.681 --> 21:10.481
Yes.

21:11.201 --> 21:12.001
Sir.

21:12.441 --> 21:13.161
Yes.

21:15.961 --> 21:18.001
(Wife of Minister Wang of Personnel)
Old Madam Sun's South Sea gem

21:18.001 --> 21:19.441
needs a red sandalwood case.

21:19.760 --> 21:21.441
Qiu Ying's painting for Chen

21:21.441 --> 21:22.481
(Wife of Vice Director Shen)
needs a signature.

21:22.641 --> 21:24.161
Madam Wang's Diamond Sutra

21:25.001 --> 21:26.760
must be written by the abbot himself.

21:30.800 --> 21:31.441
Here.

21:33.040 --> 21:34.280
Now that you are in the Yu family,

21:34.481 --> 21:36.001
you must have some respectable items

21:36.001 --> 21:37.360
to hold your own.

21:39.241 --> 21:40.320
Thank you, Aunt.

21:40.360 --> 21:41.040
Remember,

21:41.241 --> 21:42.600
now that you're part of the Yu family,

21:42.641 --> 21:44.320
you must put in a good word for me.

21:44.961 --> 21:47.881
I am your greatest support.

22:07.241 --> 22:07.921
Mr. Zhao.

22:09.681 --> 22:10.840
An urgent dispatch.

22:10.883 --> 22:13.323
(To Commader Zhao of the Capital)

22:19.080 --> 22:20.441
(Commander Zhao,)

22:20.600 --> 22:23.280
(I have recently reviewed
Anzhou salt administration archives.)

22:23.641 --> 22:25.641
(I found the old grain-for-salt system)

22:25.760 --> 22:27.280
(has serious discrepancies.)

22:27.760 --> 22:29.080
(Various embezzlement methods)

22:29.080 --> 22:30.280
(emerge without end.)

22:30.681 --> 22:32.961
(Succeeding officials, faced
with the complexity of the accounts,)

22:32.961 --> 22:34.080
(refused to investigate deeply.)

22:34.441 --> 22:36.481
(Shen Congsi of Anzhou, respectfully)
(These abuses have festered for years.)

22:42.481 --> 22:43.320
What is it?

22:44.881 --> 22:46.080
An urgent report

22:46.441 --> 22:47.840
from Shen Congsi.

22:52.520 --> 22:54.280
The former Anzhou prefect

22:54.921 --> 22:56.441
was a student of Grand Secretary Yu.

22:56.921 --> 22:59.161
Then the embezzlement
in the old Anzhou accounts

22:59.840 --> 23:01.441
most likely traces back
to the Yu family.

23:01.881 --> 23:05.080
No wonder he is pushing so hard
for the salt reform

23:06.441 --> 23:08.441
to scrap the old grain-for-salt
and switch to silver.

23:09.241 --> 23:10.481
It was all meant

23:10.481 --> 23:12.201
to collect new salt revenue

23:12.201 --> 23:13.800
to cover the old deficits.

23:14.201 --> 23:15.360
Back then, the Yan family

23:16.040 --> 23:17.280
also sold salt permits illegally

23:17.481 --> 23:18.520
and bled the merchants dry.

23:20.401 --> 23:21.840
Eight years have passed.

23:22.080 --> 23:24.120
These parasites have hatched
new schemes.

23:24.520 --> 23:26.760
It seems
no matter how the salt laws change,

23:27.721 --> 23:29.360
corruption runs rampant

23:30.401 --> 23:31.520
like weeds.

23:32.320 --> 23:34.241
But those who root out corruption

23:35.241 --> 23:36.481
are like sparks,

23:36.961 --> 23:38.120
never fading.

23:38.681 --> 23:39.520
Once,

23:39.520 --> 23:41.681
we brought down the Yan family together.

23:42.001 --> 23:42.921
Today,

23:43.241 --> 23:45.721
we will do the same to the Yu family.

23:46.721 --> 23:49.921
Since you know the old Anzhou accounts
are the key,

23:50.201 --> 23:51.280
what is your plan?

23:56.161 --> 23:58.280
Mislead them,

23:58.760 --> 23:59.760
then...

24:00.201 --> 24:01.681
Strike where they least expect.

24:02.280 --> 24:03.760
Move first, and move hard.

24:06.800 --> 24:08.241
You know me

24:10.360 --> 24:11.681
better than anyone.

24:21.118 --> 24:21.958
Oh no.

24:22.040 --> 24:23.641
What are we going to do?

24:29.161 --> 24:31.040
Grand Secretary, you're here at last.

24:31.120 --> 24:32.241
Commander Zhao is going to seal

24:32.241 --> 24:34.441
all the grain transport ledgers
passing through Anzhou.

24:34.441 --> 24:36.120
Whether they are carrying grain or salt,

24:36.120 --> 24:38.001
anything passing through
the Anzhou waterways

24:38.001 --> 24:40.080
will be sealed and fully investigated.

24:40.201 --> 24:40.921
Stay calm.

24:46.001 --> 24:49.401
Commander Zhao, shouldn't you be
suppressing water bandits?

24:49.401 --> 24:51.280
With such a large-scale operation,

24:52.800 --> 24:54.360
what are you really after?

24:55.600 --> 24:57.600
Anzhou sits at the strategic
lake-mouth pass

24:57.600 --> 24:59.001
and connects to the Grand Canal.

24:59.241 --> 25:01.080
To clear out the water bandits,

25:01.161 --> 25:02.721
I must first determine

25:02.721 --> 25:03.600
the exact amounts

25:03.600 --> 25:06.681
of money, grain, and salt
that were stolen from the court.

25:08.800 --> 25:10.040
Only then will those beasts

25:10.040 --> 25:12.320
who have devoured
the people's hard-earned wealth

25:12.360 --> 25:13.681
have nowhere to hide.

25:16.241 --> 25:19.320
So you're only using this as a pretext.

25:19.320 --> 25:20.201
Commander Zhao, turns out

25:20.201 --> 25:22.241
you are
after the old accounts of Anzhou.

25:22.481 --> 25:25.241
Why didn't you inform me sooner?

25:25.881 --> 25:27.241
The prefect of Anzhou

25:27.241 --> 25:28.881
happens to be my former student.

25:29.161 --> 25:30.441
I could have arranged

25:30.441 --> 25:32.040
some extra hands

25:32.441 --> 25:34.201
to assist you.

25:35.760 --> 25:37.001
I appreciate your kind offer,

25:37.840 --> 25:39.080
Grand Secretary.

25:44.401 --> 25:45.401
Tally the accounts.

25:45.401 --> 25:46.360
Seal the boxes.

25:48.520 --> 25:51.161
Deliver all ledgers to the
Jinwu Vanguard Office immediately.

25:52.001 --> 25:53.760
Without my direct order,

25:56.401 --> 25:58.120
no one is to touch them.

25:58.760 --> 25:59.441
Yes!

26:03.760 --> 26:05.441
He's not really after water bandits.

26:05.600 --> 26:06.520
Anzhou?

26:06.881 --> 26:08.441
He's clearly

26:08.441 --> 26:09.760
after my head!

26:13.721 --> 26:15.520
Zhao Ling has the upper hand now.

26:15.840 --> 26:17.721
He's got his eyes fixed
on Anzhou's accounts.

26:18.120 --> 26:19.241
If we try to doctor the accounts now,

26:19.241 --> 26:20.641
it's already too late.

26:21.401 --> 26:23.040
But those discrepancies in the accounts

26:23.360 --> 26:25.360
will eventually reach His Majesty.

26:27.161 --> 26:28.800
Then we muddy the waters.

26:29.921 --> 26:31.600
It's not like

26:31.760 --> 26:33.800
only Anzhou's accounts

26:33.800 --> 26:34.840
(Anzhou)
are problematic.

26:39.641 --> 26:41.441
You're counting on the idea
that the law can't punish everyone?

26:43.320 --> 26:44.520
If that works,

26:44.840 --> 26:45.921
the Yu family

26:45.921 --> 26:48.441
has at least a fifty percent chance
of walking away unscathed.

26:49.641 --> 26:51.120
But to make it happen,

26:51.721 --> 26:53.961
we need at least three months.

27:00.840 --> 27:02.201
I have a plan

27:03.001 --> 27:04.120
that will surely make Zhao Ling

27:04.120 --> 27:06.280
set aside his duties
and step away from the center of power.

27:06.961 --> 27:09.080
And it buys you another thirty percent
chance of winning.

27:18.320 --> 27:20.001
Mother!

27:21.760 --> 27:24.040
I have failed you!

27:24.681 --> 27:28.080
You toiled all your life!

27:28.120 --> 27:31.681
And now in death,
you cannot even rest in peace!

27:31.840 --> 27:33.481
(Shou)
All because of that unfilial daughter,

27:33.481 --> 27:35.760
insisting on moving your grave

27:35.800 --> 27:38.280
and tore us apart!

27:38.280 --> 27:40.080
Mother!

27:40.401 --> 27:42.040
He is a filial son.

27:42.120 --> 27:43.161
All the way here...

27:44.280 --> 27:47.040
Over mountains and rivers,

27:47.481 --> 27:50.040
you don't even have a male heir

27:50.040 --> 27:51.520
to carry your spirit banner!

27:53.520 --> 27:56.360
Where is the justice in this?

27:56.881 --> 27:58.201
I will carry the spirit banner!

28:01.001 --> 28:02.441
I will escort Grandmother home myself.

28:02.800 --> 28:04.520
Fu Tingzhuo, what are you doing here?

28:07.840 --> 28:08.881
You get back...

28:12.401 --> 28:13.080
You...

28:15.800 --> 28:16.840
What are you doing?

28:20.241 --> 28:22.441
Your grandson is here to see you!

28:26.320 --> 28:27.360
Rest assured, Grandmother.

28:28.161 --> 28:30.201
I will see you home.

28:32.760 --> 28:34.241
You will not be alone on this journey.

28:34.681 --> 28:35.681
What are you saying?

28:36.441 --> 28:37.241
I am her son!

28:37.241 --> 28:38.120
You are my son!

28:38.120 --> 28:39.360
I am the head of the Fu family!

28:39.360 --> 28:40.360
Who are you to speak?

28:40.360 --> 28:42.080
But I am her grandson!

28:43.241 --> 28:44.921
The next head of the Fu family.

28:45.120 --> 28:45.881
Besides,

28:46.320 --> 28:48.600
this matter was personally approved
by the Grand Empress Dowager.

28:49.401 --> 28:51.001
If you wish to stop me, Father,

28:51.241 --> 28:53.120
go ask the Imperial Clan Court first!

28:53.201 --> 28:53.641
You...

28:54.921 --> 28:55.760
You...

28:55.760 --> 28:57.040
Unfilial wretch!

28:57.320 --> 28:59.840
For generations,
the Fu family's name and power

28:59.921 --> 29:00.961
were built on women's blood and tears.

29:01.040 --> 29:02.201
That is the true evil.

29:02.201 --> 29:03.120
True filial piety

29:03.600 --> 29:05.681
is to cut off this vicious cycle

29:05.681 --> 29:07.201
of devouring women and kin!

29:19.040 --> 29:19.881
Fu Tingzhuo.

29:20.161 --> 29:21.481
(Spirit Banner of the Late Madam Li)
Fu Tingzhuo, how dare you!

29:21.760 --> 29:22.681
Put it down!

29:32.600 --> 29:33.681
From this day on,

29:34.721 --> 29:35.600
this evil

29:36.520 --> 29:37.760
ends with me.

29:37.903 --> 29:39.656
(Spirit Banner of the Late Madam Li
of the Fu Family)

29:40.201 --> 29:41.201
My children,

29:41.800 --> 29:43.961
remember what your father did today.

29:44.040 --> 29:45.320
Lift the coffin!

29:45.320 --> 29:47.481
Filial piety is not blind obedience.

29:48.040 --> 29:49.520
It is knowing right from wrong.

29:49.800 --> 29:50.721
Who would dare?

29:50.721 --> 29:53.120
Righteousness is not empty fame.

29:53.360 --> 29:54.800
It is breaking old rules.

29:56.800 --> 29:58.881
What your father has cut down today

29:59.320 --> 30:01.360
is a century of shackles
on the Fu family.

30:02.080 --> 30:03.080
What he has opened

30:03.641 --> 30:05.441
is a new path for generations to come.

30:06.441 --> 30:08.641
It is what filial piety should truly be.

30:46.921 --> 30:47.881
My dear.

30:48.520 --> 30:49.921
They say

30:50.280 --> 30:51.961
that only when husband and wife
are of one mind

30:52.001 --> 30:53.481
can a family be established.

30:53.840 --> 30:56.641
I truly want to build up the Fu family.

30:57.080 --> 30:58.840
Can you help me?

31:00.441 --> 31:02.120
What scheme are you cooking up now?

31:03.040 --> 31:03.800
No.

31:04.241 --> 31:07.760
If we go back to Huaying,

31:08.040 --> 31:10.520
we will always be one step behind.

31:11.881 --> 31:13.921
Why don't you pretend to be ill?

31:14.201 --> 31:16.201
I can stay behind to care for you.

31:16.280 --> 31:17.760
That way, we can stay in the capital.

31:17.760 --> 31:19.520
Then there's a chance for reinstatement.

31:19.881 --> 31:22.080
But I no longer want to play along.

31:29.441 --> 31:31.961
I have already hidden the money.

31:32.520 --> 31:33.681
You will not find it.

31:35.721 --> 31:37.441
Hand it over. Do you hear me?

31:38.520 --> 31:40.001
Twenty-six years ago,

31:40.280 --> 31:42.120
I brought thousands of qing of land

31:42.120 --> 31:43.320
into the Fu family.

31:44.241 --> 31:45.401
You said you wanted to buy

31:45.401 --> 31:47.001
a three-courtyard house in the capital,

31:47.241 --> 31:48.441
and I sold half.

31:48.961 --> 31:50.120
Ten years ago,

31:50.760 --> 31:52.401
you said you wanted to buy an office,

31:52.721 --> 31:54.441
and I pawned another hundred or so.

31:54.481 --> 31:55.600
Last month,

31:55.840 --> 31:57.520
you said you needed to pull some strings

31:57.800 --> 31:58.840
and the silver wasn't enough,

31:59.080 --> 32:00.641
so you came to me for more.

32:01.881 --> 32:03.881
What have I been doing all this for?

32:04.241 --> 32:06.840
To bring honor to the Fu family!

32:06.840 --> 32:08.520
Was it for myself?

32:11.120 --> 32:12.641
You have lived comfortably,

32:13.241 --> 32:15.040
supported by me all these years.

32:15.681 --> 32:16.721
And in the end,

32:16.881 --> 32:18.441
you torment my children.

32:18.721 --> 32:20.800
I will no longer be under your control.

32:21.401 --> 32:24.441
If you think
you can take more money from me,

32:24.681 --> 32:26.320
that is absolutely out of the question.

32:27.120 --> 32:28.441
You dare!

32:29.840 --> 32:31.441
Watch me.

32:33.877 --> 32:35.036
(Mutual-Consent Divorce Agreement)

32:35.080 --> 32:36.840
I have already written
a mutual-consent divorce agreement.

32:36.850 --> 32:38.240
(Initiating Party: Xie Yuzhen;
Joint Signatory: Fu Shichang)

32:44.103 --> 32:45.337
Oh.

32:45.520 --> 32:46.800
My dear.

32:47.241 --> 32:49.360
Whether it was twenty-six years ago,

32:49.641 --> 32:50.921
ten years ago,

32:50.921 --> 32:51.881
last month,

32:51.881 --> 32:53.080
or in the future,

32:53.241 --> 32:55.040
listen to me carefully.

32:55.201 --> 32:57.881
From the moment you married
into the Fu family,

32:58.320 --> 32:59.681
your words

33:01.040 --> 33:02.201
have never carried any weight.

33:23.921 --> 33:25.520
Master, he's here.

33:31.401 --> 33:32.241
Grand Secretary.

33:32.441 --> 33:34.441
That precious son-in-law of yours

33:35.641 --> 33:38.120
has been stirring up trouble
these past few months.

33:38.681 --> 33:40.921
I suggest he follow your example

33:40.921 --> 33:42.681
and observe mourning.

33:43.681 --> 33:45.201
You mean...

33:45.320 --> 33:47.161
Since he prides himself on being filial,

33:47.441 --> 33:49.441
he should observe a full hundred days.

33:49.441 --> 33:51.001
That would be fitting

33:51.120 --> 33:52.681
for his mother-in-law's affection.

33:52.681 --> 33:53.721
But Grand Secretary,

33:55.360 --> 33:57.080
she...

33:57.441 --> 33:59.600
She is my wife.

34:03.881 --> 34:06.441
Since your mother's grave is empty now,

34:07.401 --> 34:09.640
someone should fill it.

34:10.640 --> 34:13.001
That way, you can stay in the capital.

34:14.120 --> 34:14.761
By the way,

34:15.720 --> 34:18.881
the post of Secretary
in the Ministry of Revenue

34:19.200 --> 34:20.680
will open up

34:21.040 --> 34:23.481
in the second half of the year.

34:40.520 --> 34:41.441
Quanhui.

34:45.321 --> 34:46.040
Come here.

34:48.921 --> 34:49.841
Mother.

34:52.080 --> 34:53.080
Mother.

34:56.281 --> 34:58.120
Quanhui, you've grown up.

35:00.001 --> 35:01.640
Remember what I say.

35:03.120 --> 35:05.841
The way of husband and wife
lies in supporting each other.

35:06.600 --> 35:07.841
Though there may be hardships,

35:08.200 --> 35:09.680
face them together.

35:10.040 --> 35:11.361
Life is short.

35:11.961 --> 35:12.921
In this life,

35:13.520 --> 35:15.200
to have a true companion

35:15.441 --> 35:16.841
is the rarest gift.

35:18.520 --> 35:20.240
All wealth and glory,

35:20.441 --> 35:21.841
gold and power alike,

35:21.921 --> 35:24.040
are but fleeting dreams.

35:26.441 --> 35:27.761
I will always remember this.

35:59.321 --> 36:00.281
Mother.

36:00.881 --> 36:01.921
Mother.

36:02.720 --> 36:05.281
Mother, where have you gone? Mother!

36:15.720 --> 36:16.640
What's wrong?

36:18.200 --> 36:19.680
I dreamt of Mother.

36:28.401 --> 36:29.361
In the next day or two,

36:30.240 --> 36:31.600
I will go back with you

36:33.120 --> 36:34.080
to see her.

37:04.921 --> 37:06.520
What are you looking for, Mr. Zhao?

37:07.441 --> 37:08.401
Before,

37:08.401 --> 37:10.160
I sent a few bundles of herbs home.

37:12.200 --> 37:14.481
I remember there was some Wangyou
among them.

37:18.961 --> 37:19.640
Perfect.

37:19.961 --> 37:21.481
I can brew you a calming tonic.

37:26.680 --> 37:28.401
Let me brew it for you.

37:29.761 --> 37:32.040
I didn't know you could do that.

37:35.200 --> 37:36.841
Not only can I brew it,

37:37.040 --> 37:38.361
but I can also feed you
with my own hands.

37:39.120 --> 37:39.761
I...

37:46.401 --> 37:47.881
Let me practice a bit first.

37:49.833 --> 37:50.440
Ow!

37:50.520 --> 37:51.240
So hot!

37:51.321 --> 37:52.281
Careful.

37:57.801 --> 37:58.881
Watch out, it's hot.

38:04.001 --> 38:05.120
It's too hot.

38:11.281 --> 38:12.040
Try again.

38:14.680 --> 38:15.720
Mr. Zhao.

38:17.921 --> 38:19.680
I won't fool around. Come on.

38:21.680 --> 38:22.441
Take it slow.

38:24.961 --> 38:25.680
Is it alright?

38:27.080 --> 38:27.961
Let me try again.

38:31.401 --> 38:32.040
Come on.

38:32.680 --> 38:33.600
Madam.

38:33.680 --> 38:34.841
Ninth Young Lady!

38:35.281 --> 38:36.441
Ninth Young Lady!

38:36.640 --> 38:37.680
Fifth Madam...

38:38.481 --> 38:41.200
Fifth Madam passed away last night.

38:52.361 --> 38:54.441
This morning, white banners were hung
at the Fu Residence,

38:55.040 --> 38:56.680
and the authorities have been notified.

39:00.361 --> 39:01.441
How could this happen?

39:03.160 --> 39:04.441
At our wedding,

39:05.040 --> 39:06.761
she was still well, wasn't she?

39:06.761 --> 39:08.401
After you left home,

39:08.520 --> 39:10.481
the Fifth Madam's health
has been failing.

39:10.680 --> 39:12.240
The healer said before

39:12.240 --> 39:15.401
that her body was already worn out.

39:16.001 --> 39:18.640
She has clung to life

39:18.640 --> 39:21.080
only to avoid

39:21.080 --> 39:22.600
delaying your wedding.

39:22.801 --> 39:24.200
Last night,

39:26.640 --> 39:29.361
she could hold on no longer.

39:35.240 --> 39:35.881
Tingyun.

39:42.401 --> 39:44.921
Knowing her health was failing,

39:45.481 --> 39:46.801
she once said

39:46.841 --> 39:49.160
she wished to return to her hometown
in Jiangnan

39:49.200 --> 39:51.040
for her final rest.

39:51.720 --> 39:52.961
Ninth Young Lady,

39:53.401 --> 39:55.080
you must go and see.

39:55.481 --> 39:59.240
Fifth Master wants to bury her
in the grass hut.

40:34.063 --> 40:35.770
(In Memoriam)

40:35.801 --> 40:37.520
My wife and I

40:37.921 --> 40:39.520
treated each other with respect.

40:40.240 --> 40:42.281
She bore me children

40:42.441 --> 40:44.040
and served my parents.

40:44.481 --> 40:45.401
But in the end,

40:45.600 --> 40:50.720
she never knew a day of happiness.

40:51.321 --> 40:52.001
Now

40:52.001 --> 40:53.680
you have left before me.

40:53.720 --> 40:55.720
How could you bear to leave me?

40:56.841 --> 40:59.160
I will fulfill your final wish.

40:59.841 --> 41:01.481
I will build a hut on the outskirts,

41:02.120 --> 41:03.841
eat only vegetables and fast

41:04.441 --> 41:05.361
for six years,

41:05.640 --> 41:06.401
eight years,

41:07.240 --> 41:08.841
ten years.

41:09.040 --> 41:12.361
Even ten years cannot redeem my regret!

41:12.761 --> 41:13.680
The Fifth Master's devotion

41:13.720 --> 41:16.361
to his mother was deeply moving.

41:16.881 --> 41:19.240
And now, his love for his wife
is equally deep.

41:19.761 --> 41:20.640
Truly,

41:20.801 --> 41:22.961
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Madam Xie)
he's loyal and filial!

41:23.080 --> 41:23.961
Yes.

41:24.200 --> 41:25.321
Yes.

41:28.361 --> 41:29.281
Madam,

41:30.080 --> 41:32.321
your daughter and son-in-law

41:32.640 --> 41:34.281
have come to see you.

41:35.120 --> 41:37.160
They are all grown up now.

41:38.160 --> 41:39.881
They can take care of themselves.

41:42.040 --> 41:44.160
So go in peace.

41:52.441 --> 41:55.761
Look,
Tingyun is offering incense for you.

42:01.839 --> 42:04.946
(In Memoriam)

42:10.719 --> 42:12.169
(Spirit Tablet of the Late Madam Xie)

42:22.761 --> 42:23.801
My dear,

42:24.680 --> 42:27.921
how could you bear to leave us?

42:28.441 --> 42:31.200
I will plant a loquat tree
in the courtyard.

42:32.160 --> 42:33.481
In years to come,

42:34.401 --> 42:35.921
it will grow into a great shade.

42:36.200 --> 42:38.401
When we eat its fruit,

42:39.200 --> 42:42.160
we will see your face
and hear your voice again.

42:43.481 --> 42:44.801
How long are you going

42:47.481 --> 42:49.321
to keep up this little show?

43:04.163 --> 43:06.820
(Next Episode)

43:07.361 --> 43:09.200
You are no longer part of the Fu family.

43:09.281 --> 43:10.640
What right do you have
to meddle in our affairs?

43:10.640 --> 43:12.680
You can talk until you are blue
in the face,

43:13.160 --> 43:16.200
but I will still take Mother back
to the Xie family in Jiangnan!

43:16.801 --> 43:17.921
Zhao Ling!

43:17.921 --> 43:19.600
Even if I am a heartless wretch,

43:19.720 --> 43:21.481
I am still Fu Tingyun's birth father!

43:21.481 --> 43:23.640
You two will pay for this!

43:23.921 --> 43:25.881
We've come so far to get here.

43:25.881 --> 43:27.401
Why the rush?

43:29.640 --> 43:31.321
You are willing to part
with your mother-in-law today.

43:31.761 --> 43:32.640
Tomorrow,

43:32.801 --> 43:34.560
who else will you be willing
to part with?

43:35.600 --> 43:37.761
(I will make you pay blood for blood.)

43:50.000 --> 43:54.320
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

43:57.920 --> 44:02.280
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

44:04.400 --> 44:09.040
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

44:09.280 --> 44:12.080
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

44:13.240 --> 44:17.880
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

44:21.080 --> 44:27.920
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

